        "source_quote": "Inventory movement has accelerated and stock is now turned over four times a year, as companies deploy a mix of strategies to clear their warehouses from sales and promotions (used by 77%), to liquidation (39%), and moving goods to other locations (34%). Half the firms are using at least two of these tactics, up from 38% in 2024.",
